---
import { brand } from "@goliath/ui/brand";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Custom development"
  description="Goliath Research Inc. builds applied software, domain process packs, and focused platform pilots on the published Goliath stack."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Applied Software Engineering</p>
      <h1>Custom Development &amp; Pilots</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Goliath Research Inc. builds applied software, domain process packs, and focused pilot applications on
        our published open-source stack.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our engineering work includes custom domain adaptations and operational pilots on{" "}
        <a href="/technology/">GoliathApp</a> (such as launch-ops and ground-station monitoring with{" "}
        <a href="/products/goliathgroundstation/">GoliathGroundStation</a>), bioinformatics process packs and
        analytical pipelines on <a href="/omics/">GoliathOmics</a>, and high-performance integrations or
        platform expansions around our ready standalone utilities{" "}
        <a href="/products/goliathalign/">GoliathAlign</a> (linear and pangenome alignment on NVIDIA and AMD
        platforms) and <a href="/products/goliath-extractor/">GoliathExtractor</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We are looking for focused operational or research problems suitable for a small, measurable pilot.
        See our <a href="/partnerships/">Partnerships page</a> for how we structure education, research, and
        industry collaborations.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/partnerships/">Partnership opportunities</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={brand.contactMailto}>{brand.contactEmail}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
